    IDEAL SITEMAP FOR docs.rtb.cat
    Generated for AEO + SEO (AI model ingestion + search).

    Trimmings included:
    - Accurate <lastmod> from git commits (via freshness hook on build)
    - <priority> tuned for AEO (Explainers boosted because this is the high-signal content for models)
    - <changefreq> (weekly for fresh explainers, monthly for stable chapters)
    - Image sitemap extension for pages with screenshots (helps rich results + context for models)
    - xhtml:link for language alternates (multi-lang support)
    - All English + Explainers + representative language variants

    How it's used:
    - The freshness.py hook (in hooks/) automatically enriches the MkDocs-generated sitemap.xml
      at build time with real git lastmod + the priorities/images above.
    - Place this file as reference. The hook produces the live version in site/sitemap.xml.
    - Submit to Google Search Console + Bing Webmaster Tools.
    - AI crawlers (ClaudeBot, GPTBot, etc.) and the models' web_search tools love clean, dated, first-party sitemaps.
  -->

